<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage rises to 11.223bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage rises to 11.223bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 11.223 billion rand on Wednesday from 11.147 billion rand on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
